type: software
title: "depeg-ews: an early-warning benchmark for stablecoin and liquid-staking depegs"
abstract: "Code of an hourly early-warning benchmark for depegs of stablecoins and liquid-staking tokens on Ethereum (52 assets, 2023-2026), with onset, escalation and contagion tasks, a lending-exposure graph, and the scripts that rebuild every number in the paper."
